# Snapshots, not symlink targets.
#
# `omarchy bar ...` and the bar's drag gestures rewrite shell.json / shell.toml
# with mktemp + mv, which REPLACES a symlink with a regular file. Stowing them
# would silently detach this repo from the live config, so they are tracked as
# copies and refreshed with ./omarchy/sync-shell-config.
shell\.json
shell\.toml
sync-shell-config
README\.md
